From b282587afc24e932d215f2d878622315564f4219 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohammed <91819504+mohammed7s@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:07:25 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] computercontrol: authorize installed assistants and revoke
 live access

Allow role-managed access alongside the privileged grant. Require both owner gates for ordinary assistants, including DeviceConfig alternatives. Invalidate pending consent on withdrawal, watch role/permission/policy/package changes, close on AppOp withdrawal, protect PermissionController before special paths, and expose a signature-only target eligibility query. Include the OS fingerprint in role reconciliation so upgraded images regrant existing holders.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
